  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Portfolio analysis health Bangladesh 2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Portf&#xf6;ljanalys h&#xe4;lsa Bangladesh 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden i Dhaka har beslutat att g&#xf6;ra en analys av h&#xe4;lsoportf&#xf6;ljen som ett bidrag till fattigdomsanalysen samt till analysen av behov av fortsatt utveckling av h&#xe4;lsoportf&#xf6;ljen i relation till kontexten och inf&#xf6;r en kommande ny strategi f&#xf6;r svensk utvecklingssamarbete med Bangladesh efter 2020. KIT &#xe4;r rangordnad som nummer ett i g&#xe4;llande ramavtal inom h&#xe4;lsa och SRHR. De har antagit uppdraget med ber&#xe4;knad arbetstid p&#xe5; h&#xf6;gst 19 konsultdagar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy in Dhaka has decided to make an analysis of the health portfolio as a contribution to the poverty analysis as well as to the analysis of the need for continued development of the health portfolio in relation to the context and for a forthcoming new strategy for Swedish development cooperation with Bangladesh after 2020. KIT is ranked number one in current framework agreements within health and SRHR. They have accepted the assignment with an estimated working time of no more than 19 consulting days.</narrative>
  </description>
